  "headline": "Tito Karnavian Urges Regulatory Harmonization for Regional Progress",
  "seoTitle": "Tito Karnavian on Regional Regulation Harmonization",
  "metaDescription": "Minister of Home Affairs Tito Karnavian emphasizes the importance of synchronizing thousands of regional regulations to improve local development.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Minister Tito Karnavian highlighted the need to manage and harmonize over 17,000 regional regulations during a national coordination meeting.",
    "The government is focusing on regional infrastructure and digital transformation to stimulate economic growth in priority areas.",
